               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_0c983cc8">On the secondary title page, in lower left-hand corner in Gade's hand: "Niels W. Gade / Organist fra / 1. octbr. 1858". Several additions in pencil and blue crayon by Gade. Also a few later additions. On p. 138 in upper left-hand corner before the heading  "Nr. 124. O gode Gud, jeg takker dig", Gade has added :"Børne og Skolesang". On p. 73 he has written: "124 O gode Gud, jeg takker dig; comp. 1836 af N.W. Gade (s. mine 'Sange til Skolebrug', 3die Hefte, 1ste Udg., 1836)".</physMedium>
